  "implementation": [
    "Route speculative PP P/D through the synchronous stage coordinator and existing disaggregated planners.",
    "Coordinate ordered request IDs, bootstrap rooms, phase labels and poll results before consuming P/D queues.",
    "Require metadata readiness and all-stage terminal transfer state before success/failure cleanup; request abort markers cannot bypass a live backend transfer.",
    "Reduce bootstrap metadata slots and decode request/metadata/token budgets before admission or resume.",
    "Broadcast the last P stage TP0 first-teacher handoff after sampled-token D2H, before sending the final KV chunk.",
    "Rebuild D draft context from received target KV, then retain owner-local Store writes and cohort publication.",
    "Permit Mooncake static target-KV PP with DP1/CP1 and device KV cache; reject optimistic prefill, transfer staging and KV offload.",
    "Extend the real P/D fixture to stop both model producers and re-read every published tensor with digest/content validation."
  ],
